<title>USA: GSR Industries IPO delayed - underwriter.</title>
<headline>GSR Industries IPO delayed - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>GSR Industries Inc's initial public offering has been delayed, said underwriter Bluestone Capital Partners LP.</p>
<p>No reason was given for the delay.</p>
<p>The company was to offer 3.3 million shares at an expected price of $9 to $11 per share.</p>
<p>Houston-based GSR makes ashphalt-based roofing products.</p>
